Z||000001||stimpy||06-22-2001||06:56 PM||||Ahh, good times. For folks who might be interested in coming to Fiero Fest X, we are exploring getting a new location. While the dealership has been extremely supportive, some feel that a more parklike setting might be a lot more comfortable. another item on the table is to collaborate with the Pontiac club in putting on a more interesting show. I'll be keeping y'all posted||||reg||10
